    "media:imagetext": "MAIN CABIN DOOR OPERATION\nHAND CRANK HERE\nTO OPEN DOOR\nTURN HAND CRANK\nPUSH STAIR OUT\nEXIT\nOPEN\n1\nTO OPEN DOOR FLIP THE\nRED GUARDED SWITCH UP\nSERVICE DOOR OPERATION\nEXIT\nT\nPULL HANDLE DOWN\n2\nLIFT TO RAISE DOOR\nALL THE WAY UP-\nSLIDE WILL EJECT AND\nINFLATE AUTOMATICALLY\n3\nIF SLIDE DOES MOT\nINFLATE AUTOMATICALLY\nJERK THIS HANDLE\nLOUNGE DOOR OPERATION\nEXIT\nHAND\nGRIP\nPULL\n1 COVER\n2\nPULL\nHANDLE\nSLIDE\n3\nREMOVE DOOR - SHOWN ABOVE\n4 LIFT FLAP - PULL HANDLE UP\nSTAND CLEAR - SLIDE WILL\nAUTOMATICALLY EJECT AND\nINFLATE FOR USE\nSTAND CLEAR\nOF THIS AREA\nWINDOW OPERATION\nPULL\nCOVER\n1\nPULL\nHANDLE\n2\nTHERE ARE 3 WINDOW EXITS IN\nTHE MAIN CABIN\n3\nREMOVE WINDOW\nHOLIDAY AIRLINES\n2\nAFTER DOOR IS OPEN\nPUSH STAIRS OUT\n4 AFTER\nINFLA-\nTION\nCOMPLETE\nJUMP DOWN\nSLIDE\n5\nAFTER INFLATION COMPLETE -\nJUMP DOWN SLIDE\n4 CLIMB OUT WINDOW\nA FAST WAY OUT THE WINDOW IS\nONE LEG FIRST, THEN HEAD AND\nBODY FOLLOWED BY OTHER LEG.\nREV. 1-15-72",
